# Supply-chain cooldown: npm only resolves versions published at least this
# many days ago. Lockfile installs (npm ci) are unaffected; this applies when
# adding or updating dependencies. Dependabot uses the same delay
# (.github/dependabot.yml). Override deliberately for an urgent security fix:
#   npm install <pkg>@<version> --min-release-age=0
min-release-age=7
